  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Services Participating Agency Service Agreement (PASA) for USDA support to USAID in the areas of agriculture, gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Services Provided: Under this PASA USDA FAS Office of Capacity Building and Development provide technical staff and short-term technical assistance to assist USAID Bureau of Food Security, Office of Israeli Programs (EGAT/AG/IP), and USAID&apos;s Office of Gender Equalilty and Women&apos;s Empowerment (EGAT/GENDEV) to carry out their technical leadership, program management, and field support responsibilities. FAS also provides administrative support to the PASA technical staff to effectively carryout their tasks in support of USAID.</narrative>
  </description>
